1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,640
(Leonard:)Thanks, yeah.
Sure.

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:03,440
(Bernadette:)Let me help you.

3
00:00:04,990 --> 00:00:08,040
(Howard:)Nice to see that the gals
are getting along.

4
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:10,110
"Gals"?

5
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:12,450
(Leonard:)Who are you, Fred Flintstone?

6
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,620
(Penny:)This trip to India
sounds fun.

7
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,050
(Priya:)Yeah, I think it will be.

8
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:19,990
(Bernadette:)Are you concerned your parents
might not approve of Leonard?

9
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:21,720
(Priya:)A little.

10
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,630
(Priya:)They're very old-fashioned.

11
00:00:23,630 --> 00:00:25,190
(Bernadette:)Well, I wouldn't
worry about it.

12
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:27,400
(Bernadette:)It's not like you guys
are getting engaged, right?

13
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:32,570
(Priya:)Oh, God, no.
We're not there yet.

14
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:35,400
(Bernadette:)Not engaged.
Very interesting.

15
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,770
(Bernadette:)I have to tinkle.

16
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:38,710
(Priya:)You've been in there
a lot tonight. Are you okay?

17
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:42,240
(Sheldon:)Yes.
Are you writing a book?

18
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:44,380
(Priya:)Why are you getting upset?

19
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:47,050
(Bernadette:)I'm not upset.
Maybe you're upset.

20
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:49,350
(Priya:)What's up with you?

21
00:00:51,890 --> 00:00:53,720
(Amy:)Bernadette?

22
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:57,060
(Bernadette:)I can't do this anymore!

23
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:59,190
(Bernadette:)I'm a good girl!

